{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04478","headline":"酬田逸人游岩见寻不遇题隐居里壁 · 陈子昂","name":"酬田逸人游岩见寻不遇题隐居里壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游人献书去，薄暮返灵台。\n传道寻仙友，青囊卖卜来。\n闻莺忽相访，题凤久裴回。\n石髓空盈握，金经秘不开。\n还疑缝掖子，复似洛阳才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}